  "sdo:description": "SONORA will assess the impacts of anthropogenic and seismic underwater noise on fish behaviour. The team is multidisciplinary reaching from a number of core sciences to decision makers responsible for management of marine activities such as aquaculture ventures and seabed exploitation. Additionally, the project will engage the private sector through sub-contracting. Using experimental and modelling techniques, the project will use state of the art technology to devlop our understanding of fish behaviour under noise exposure.",
